        {
          "anchor" : "overview",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Overview",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The design describes the model from user’s perspective. The content and data structures needed",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "for the modelling process – for the editing – are different than the data used by the machine to",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "perform the simulation. Simulation plan contains validated and derived information from the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "design.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The simulation plan is created by the ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticFlows\/documentation\/PoieticFlows\/SimulationPlanningSystems",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : " and typically used by the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticFlows\/documentation\/PoieticFlows\/StockFlowSimulationSystem",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : ". It can be also used to explain the simulation process (loosely",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "analogous to a SQL explain plan).",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The primary content of the simulation plan is:",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "items" : [
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "List of simulation objects ",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
